      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Cronin Wall Properties are delighted to present 24 Holly Court; a bright, beautifully presented and recently renovated 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom apartment ideally situated within the highly regarded Holly Court development in Midleton. South facing and enjoying excellent natural light, especially throughout the main living area, this attractive property is presented in excellent condition throughout, making it ready for immediate occupation.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation offers a comfortable and practical layout with well proportioned living spaces, while the recently renovated interiors and flooring provide a fresh and contemporary feel.\r\n\r\nHolly Court is a well-maintained, gated development offering residents private and secure parking, landscaped communal areas and a pleasant residential setting. The development is ideally positioned close to Midleton town centre, with a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, recreational facilities and everyday amenities and excellent proximity to Midleton Train Station, making it an ideal choice for commuters travelling to Cork City and surrounding areas. The N25 road network is also easily accessible, further enhancing the property's appeal.\r\n\r\nViewing this turn-key property with us is an absolute must.\r\n\r\nAccommodation consists of: Entrance Hallway, Kitchen / Living Area, Bedroom, Master Bedroom and En-Suite, W.C., Balcony. Room sizes are indicative ONLY.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway 3.83m x 1.04m: Wooden flooring, Radiator, Light Fixture, Alarm, Wall power sockets.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Living Area 3.92m x 5.51m Overhead light fixture, Wooden Flooring in living area & Tiled in kitchen, radiator, Double glazed double doors for Balcony access, Washing Machine, Gas hob & Oven unit with extractor fan, Dishwasher, Fridge-Freezer, Stainless Steel Sink, Built-in Storage units\r\n\r\nBedroom: 3.21m x 3.58m Overhead light fixture, Radiator, Double bed, Wall Sockets.\r\n\r\nW.C.: 2.19m x 1.71m Radiator, w.h.b, w.c., Wall mounted mirror with light, Shower.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: 3.00m x 4.48m Overhead light fixture, Wardrobe, En-suite, bed frame, Radiator.\r\n\r\nEn-suite: 2.45m x 0.98m Tiled flooring, Shower tiling, Shower, w.h.b, w.c., wall mounted mirror with light.\r\n\r\nViewings are strictly with Sole Selling Agent.\r\n\r\nTo arrange an appointment please email us at info@croninwall.ie, or contact us on 021 463 0400"
      },
